  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice cucumber into thin sticks. Zest lime to get a generous pinch and cut into wedges.\n• Pick and roughly chop mint. Thinly slice long red chilli (see ingredients), if using.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96eae21cebe74d607e256/step-00822239.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine dark roasted peanut butter, the hot water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people), brown sugar, soy sauce and a generous squeeze of lime juice.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned and warmed through, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add peanut butter sauce mixture, then simmer until slightly thickened, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96eae21cebe74d607e256/step-197661e0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While tofu is cooking, combine sweet chilli sauce, lime zest and mayonnaise in a small bowl. Set aside.\n• In a medium bowl, combine slaw mix, mint, a squeeze of lime juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts, or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96eae21cebe74d607e256/step-3e0ef60a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread some sweet chilli mayo over tortillas. Top with some mint slaw, cucumber and satay tofu.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots and chilli (if using) to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96eae21cebe74d607e256/step-a04abd84.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
